  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.195\n\nReleased on 2026-10-25.\n\nSame release as 0.8.194 plus two small fixes: repeated stylesheet imports are kept, and lint allows zoom on scoped descendants.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Lint:** Allow scoped descendant zoom ([e2129c39150e0](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e2129c39150e006e2041b6ea11ac27fad38776b1), [#6254](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6254)).\n- **Core:** Preserve repeated stylesheet imports ([d44f67ac1db6a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/d44f67ac1db6afc71bcb0e98c1cf44059b607743), [#6250](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6250)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.194...v0.8.195\n"
